        "text": "Jawaharial \"Omar\" Williams, a former laborer and union member, has represented the 10th District in the Illinois House since his appointment in May 2019. He chairs the House Committee on Prescription Drug Affordability. He supports protecting women's rights to quality reproductive healthcare and the right to earn a fair wage. He sponsored a law to expand access to opioid antagonists at concert venues. He also sponsored the Illinois Receivership Act, which became law, and legislation regarding ammunition vending machines.",
